{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124266","id":4777730022,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHMZf5g","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124266","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124266.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124266.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124266","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124266/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124266/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124266/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5a9be8b534ce8408c939c661d9a97408f6725948","number":124266,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Allow NavigationMesh to exist even when 2D module is disabled.","user":{"login":"ALiwoto","id":70187458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTg3NDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70187458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto","html_url":"https://github.com/ALiwoto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe [NavigationMesh](https://github.com/ALiwoto/official-godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/scene/resources/navigation_mesh.h#L37) class itself does not depend on 2D module directly, however, currently it's not being registered in the typesystem due to an `#ifndef`.\r\n\r\nThis PR brings it out of that if macro so it gets registered.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nFor example, imagine you want to create a server for a 3D game, and you don't need to process anything related to 2D space; but you still need the 3D module and navigation processing. with current godot code, your code will crash at startup when trying to load your resources, because godot can't find `NavigationMesh` type.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"